    1 & -\rho & & \\
    -\rho & 1+\rho^2 & -\rho & \\
     & \ddots & \ddots & \ddots \\
     & & -\rho & 1
  \end{pmatrix}.}

\code{\link[=param_solve]{param_solve()}} returns it from that form, so no factorization is performed
